WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.134
Thompson's group F, not amenable.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.482
Maps of an interval with dyadic breaks.

3
00:00:05.482 --> 00:00:08.163
Asked in nineteen seventy-nine, and long contested.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.795
Averaging over invariant sets would force a fixed point that cannot exist.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.265
Claimed: F has no invariant mean.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.032
Lean: main theorem.
